query.description:
Life cycle stage of the project.
- `scheduled` means that the project has no funding rounds or public token sales and has only possible plans to launch a token;
- `funding` means that the project conducts private fundraising rounds and has not launched a token yet;
- `crowdsale` means that the project conducts public fundraising rounds and has not launched a token yet;
- `traded` means that the project has launched token and that token is being traded on exchanges;
- `inactive` means that the token has been traded before, but there is no current data about its price.
